  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1401.13 “Carnival or amusement ride” means “carnival or amusement ride” as defined in RSA 321-A:1, I.\n\nSource. #8045, eff 2-20-04; ss by #10131, eff 5-18-12, EXPIRED: 5-18-22\n\nNew. #13535, INTERIM, 1-25-23; ss by #13666, eff 6-20-23; ss by #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (formerly Saf-C 1401.09) (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
